			"notes": "## Changes\n\n- Modular core (ConfigService, RestrictionPolicy, listeners, services)\n- Stronger enforcement (defaults off): debris, scrap/ingot craft, piglin barter, pickup, join-strip, equip block\n- Bypass permission, inventory refunds, message pack, tab-complete\n- Admin tools: inspect, config GUI, audit log, soft limits\n- PlaceholderAPI soft-depend\n- Discord release notifications via webhook"
		},
